# Der Koloss — environment template
#
# Copy to `.env` for local tooling if you need it. `.env` is gitignored.
#
# The game needs NO environment variables and NO secrets. It is a static site
# with no build step: serve this directory over any local web server and it
# runs. Nothing below is read at runtime by the game.
#
# There are no API keys, no accounts, and no analytics. The only network calls
# the client makes are for its own assets and for peer-to-peer co-op, which uses
# the public PeerJS broker (0.peerjs.com) — no account, no key, no config.

# Canonical domain for share/invite links if you deploy your own copy.
# Consumed by deploy tooling only — never by the game.
# SITE_URL=https://example.com
